Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:34:59 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] docs(guide): Model to Machine claims agree with the tree

Review of PR #4059 found four product claims that the tree does not
support. Each is corrected and pinned against the machine files and the
post table of posting.md.

- The machine file section names Show work envelope. It no longer says
  that the simulation shows a moving machine.
- The Sodick ALC400G row says that the control is not confirmed and that
  the user selects the post.
- The Makera Carvera is in the Mill row, as its machine file declares.
- The Mach3 row names the five PCNC 770 and PCNC 1100 templates. Mach4
  has its own row with no dedicated machine file.

Two notes of the review are also applied: the post bullet says "offers",
and the Wire EDM row links to the post table of posting.md.

